  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avfall Norge Clean Oceans through Clean Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &quot;Clean Ocean through Clean Communities&quot; is part of the Norwegian development assistance program against marine litter and microplastics. It aims to reduce marine littering through improved Solid Waste management. The main activites are capacity building, development of Waste Management Plans (WMP) and support new value chains. Main geographical focus is on Indonesia and India.</narrative>
  </description>
